img-with-animation skip-lazy\" data-delay=\"0\" height=\"113\" width=\"200\" data-animation=\"grow-in\" src=\"https://livingrhea.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/The-Huffington-Post.jpg\" alt=\"\"  />\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\t\t\t</div> \n\t\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div>\n\t\t<div id=\"fws_6ae14cb63ca9e\"  data-column-margin=\"default\" data-midnight=\"dark\"  class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row vc_row-o-equal-height vc_row-flex  top_margin_80px\"  style=\"padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; \"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\" data-bg-animation=\"none\" data-bg-animation-delay=\"\" data-bg-overlay=\"false\"><div class=\"inner-wrap row-bg-layer\" ><div class=\"row-bg viewport-desktop\"  style=\"\"></div></div></div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12 col span_12 dark left\">\n\t<div style=\"\" class=\"vc_col-sm-6 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col no-extra-padding inherit_tablet inherit_phone \" data-using-bg=\"true\" data-bg-cover=\"true\" data-padding-pos=\"all\" data-has-bg-color=\"false\" data-bg-color=\"\" data-bg-opacity=\"1\" data-animation=\"\" data-delay=\"0\" >\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\" ><div class=\"column-image-bg-wrap column-bg-layer viewport-desktop\" data-bg-pos=\"center center\" data-bg-animation=\"none\" data-bg-overlay=\"false\"><div class=\"inner-wrap\"><div class=\"column-image-bg\" style=\" background-image: url('https://livingrhea.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/RheaBioCover.jpg'); \"></div></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"divider-wrap\" data-alignment=\"default\"><div style=\"height: 300px;\" class=\"divider\"></div></div>\n\t\t\t</div> \n\t\t</div>\n\t</div> \n\n\t<div  class=\"vc_col-sm-6 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col no-extra-padding inherit_tablet inherit_phone \"  data-padding-pos=\"all\" data-has-bg-color=\"false\" data-bg-color=\"\" data-bg-opacity=\"1\" data-animation=\"\" data-delay=\"0\" >\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\" >\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"nectar-split-heading \" data-align=\"default\" data-m-align=\"inherit\" data-text-effect=\"default\" data-animation-type=\"line-reveal-by-space\" data-animation-delay=\"0\" data-animation-offset=\"\" data-m-rm-animation=\"\" data-stagger=\"\" data-custom-font-size=\"false\" ><h2 style=\"max-width: 450px;\">DR. RHEA MEHTA</h2></div>\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \" style=\" max-width: 500px; display: inline-block;\">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t<p><strong>Is a scientist, healer and innovator known for being on the pulse of what the world needs, often before it knows it.</strong></p>\n<p>For the past 20 years, Dr. Rhea has worked as a holistic health coach and toxicologist helping women reclaim their health through nutrition science, detox protocols, and more recently, fertility support and postpartum recovery. She&#8217;s Science-backed &amp; Ayurveda-informed.</p>\n<p>She is the co-founder of <strong>Aste Wellness</strong>, a ritual-led skincare brand rooted in Ayurvedic wisdom. From smoothies to psychedelics, breathwork to blockchain, Rhea has long been a voice at the leading edge of healing, blending ancient practices with future-facing technologies to empower more conscious, connected living.</p>\n<p>With a <strong>PhD in Molecular Toxicology and Nutritional Biochemistry</strong>, <strong>Certification in Integrative Nutrition &amp; Health Coaching</strong>, and <strong>Teacher Trainings in Kriya Yoga and Sound Ceremony</strong>, her work bridges East and West, bringing science and soul into sacred conversation.</p>\n<p>An <strong>award-winning Mantra Artist</strong>, Rhea released her debut EP, Soul Ceremony, in 2021, an immersive collection of sacred sounds designed to awaken presence, peace, and connection. Her music is an extension of her healing work, weaving ancient mantras into modern soundscapes to invite stillness and transformation.</p>\n<p>Rhea is founding team member of <strong>Diamond Therapeutics</strong>, a mental health company pioneering non-hallucinogenic psychedelics, the founder of <strong>Global Smoothie Day</strong>, a movement to inspire healthy living, Co-founder of <strong>Bowhead Health</strong>, a privacy-first health tech company leveraging AI for clinical trials, and <strong>Reset</strong>, a tech-free wellness camp designed to reconnect adults to self.</p>\n<p>Her work is a remembrance: that science can be sacred, and that healing begins within.</p>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"nectar-cta  alignment_tablet_default alignment_phone_default display_tablet_inherit display_phone_inherit \" data-color=\"default\" data-using-bg=\"false\" data-style=\"arrow-animation\" data-display=\"block\" data-alignment=\"left\" data-text-color=\"custom\" ><h4 style=\"color: #ff6716;\"><span class=\"link_wrap\" ><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"link_text\" role=\"button\" href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/sslhm85dv4rfrdnuacm3g/DR.-RHEA-PhD-Speaker-kit.pdf?rlkey=yl34dqxgu6qm6icimhv100e19&#038;dl=1\"><span class=\"text\">Download speaker kit</span><svg class=\"next-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20px\" height=\"25px\" viewBox=\"0 0 50 80\" xml:space=\"preserve\">\n  <polyline stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"9\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" points=\"0, 0 45, 40 0, 80\"/>\n  </svg>  <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line\"  style=\"background-color: #ff6716;\"></span> </a></span></h4></div><div class=\"nectar-cta  alignment_tablet_default alignment_phone_default display_tablet_inherit display_phone_inherit \" data-color=\"default\" data-using-bg=\"false\" data-style=\"arrow-animation\" data-display=\"block\" data-alignment=\"left\" data-text-color=\"custom\" ><h4 style=\"color: #ff6716;\"><span class=\"link_wrap\" ><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"link_text\" role=\"button\" href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/tzeclqwgowkwa3wdwxwg1/Dr.Rhea_Aste-Wellness-Speaker-Kit.pdf?rlkey=dkcqzxsasqmemsbqr5maiucqg&#038;dl=1\"><span class=\"text\">Aste Wellness founder speaker kit</span><svg class=\"next-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20px\" height=\"25px\" viewBox=\"0 0 50 80\" xml:space=\"preserve\">\n  <polyline stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"9\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" points=\"0, 0 45, 40 0, 80\"/>\n  </svg>  <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line\"  style=\"background-color: #ff6716;\"></span> </a></span></h4></div><div class=\"divider-wrap\" data-alignment=\"default\"><div style=\"margin-top: 5px; height: 1px; margin-bottom: 5px;\" data-width=\"100%\" data-animate=\"\" data-animation-delay=\"\" data-color=\"default\" class=\"divider-border\"></div></div><blockquote class=\"nectar_single_testimonial\" data-color=\"\" data-style=\"basic\"><div class=\"inner\"> <p>&#8220;<i>There is something a little bit magical about Rhea Mehta. Maybe it’s all the superfoods she eats. She radiates good health and is a fountainhead of wisdom about all aspects of deep nutrition and even deeper living. Prepare to be supercharged. </i>&#8221; </p><div role=\"presentation\" data-shadow=\"\" class=\"image-icon \" style=\"background-image: url(https://livingrhea.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/jeff-warren_bio1-crop-300x300.jpg);\"></div><span class=\"wrap\"><span>Jeff Warren</span><span class=\"title\">Author and Meditation Teacher</span></span></div></blockquote>\n\t\t\t</div> \n\t\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div>\n\t\t<div id=\"about\"  data-column-margin=\"90px\" data-midnight=\"dark\" data-top-percent=\"4%\" data-bottom-percent=\"4%\"  class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row vc_row-o-equal-height vc_row-flex vc_row-o-content-middle\"  style=\"padding-top: calc(100vw * 0.04); padding-bottom: calc(100vw * 0.04); \"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\" data-bg-animation=\"none\" data-bg-animation-delay=\"\" data-bg-overlay=\"false\"><div class=\"inner-wrap row-bg-layer\" ><div class=\"row-bg viewport-desktop\"  style=\"\"></div></div></div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12 col span_12 dark left\">\n\t<div  class=\"vc_col-sm-6 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col padding-2-percent inherit_tablet inherit_phone \"  data-padding-pos=\"top-bottom\" data-has-bg-color=\"false\" data-bg-color=\"\" data-bg-opacity=\"1\" data-animation=\"\" data-delay=\"0\" >\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\" >\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<div id=\"fws_6ae14cb63f156\" data-midnight=\"\" data-column-margin=\"default\" class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row inner_row\"  style=\"\"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\"> <div class=\"row-bg\" ></div> </div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12_inner col span_12  left\">\n\t<div  class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column has-animation no-extra-padding inherit_tablet inherit_phone \"   data-padding-pos=\"all\" data-has-bg-color=\"false\" data-bg-color=\"\" data-bg-opacity=\"1\" data-animation=\"fade-in-from-bottom\" data-delay=\"0\" >\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\" >\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"nectar-split-heading \" data-align=\"default\" data-m-align=\"inherit\" data-text-effect=\"default\" data-animation-type=\"line-reveal-by-space\" data-animation-delay=\"0\" data-animation-offset=\"\" data-m-rm-animation=\"\" data-stagger=\"\" data-custom-font-size=\"false\" ><h2 style=\"max-width: 450px;\">MY STORY</h2></div>\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \" style=\" max-width: 500px; display: inline-block;\">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t<p>I was born in a small Northern Canadian town to Indian immigrant parents. My mother from India, and my father a refugee from East Africa. <strong>My earliest memories are of navigating chronic health challenges with few resources, but anchored by a quiet resilience and unwavering hope.</strong></p>\n<p>Years later, while completing my PhD in Molecular Toxicology, a personal health crisis forced me to turn the scientific lens inward. <strong>That was the beginning of my healing &#8211; through food, ritual, and a reconnection to breath.</strong></p>\n<p>When <strong>I lost my father</strong> to digestive cancer, that healing deepened.</p>\n<p>When <strong>I became a mother</strong>, it was tested all over again.</p>\n<p>These moments have shaped the way I see wellness &#8211; not as perfection, but as devotion.</p>\n<p><strong>Today, I help others reclaim their health as a holistic health coach and toxicologist, through ancient wisdom, conscious science, and a remembering of what’s already within. </strong></p>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"nectar-cta  alignment_tablet_default alignment_phone_default display_tablet_inherit display_phone_inherit \" data-color=\"default\" data-using-bg=\"false\" data-style=\"see-through\" data-display=\"block\" data-alignment=\"left\" data-text-color=\"std\" ><h6> <span class=\"text\">Work with me. </span><span class=\"link_wrap\" ><a  class=\"link_text\" role=\"button\" href=\"https://livingrhea.com/coaching/\"><span class=\"arrow\"></span></a></span></h6></div>\n\t\t</div> \n\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div>\n\t\t\t</div> \n\t\t</div>\n\t</div> \n\n\t<div style=\"\" class=\"vc_col-sm-6 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col padding-5-percent inherit_tablet inherit_phone \" data-using-bg=\"true\" data-bg-cover=\"true\" data-padding-pos=\"all\" data-has-bg-color=\"false\" data-bg-color=\"\" data-bg-opacity=\"1\" data-animation=\"\" data-delay=\"0\" >\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\" ><div class=\"column-image-bg-wrap column-bg-layer viewport-desktop\" data-bg-pos=\"center center\" data-bg-animation=\"zoom-out-reveal\" data-bg-overlay=\"false\"><div class=\"inner-wrap\"><div class=\"column-image-bg\" style=\" background-image: url('https://livingrhea.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/story.jpg'); \"></div></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"divider-wrap\" data-alignment=\"default\"><div style=\"height: 300px;\" class=\"divider\"></div></div>\n\t\t\t</div> \n\t\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div>\n\t\t<div id=\"about\"  data-column-margin=\"90px\" data-midnight=\"dark\" data-top-percent=\"4%\" data-bottom-percent=\"4%\"  class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row vc_row-o-equal-height vc_row-flex vc_row-o-content-middle\"  style=\"padding-top: calc(100vw * 0.04); padding-bottom: calc(100vw * 0.04); \"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\" data-bg-animation=\"none\" data-bg-animation-delay=\"\" data-bg-overlay=\"false\"><div class=\"inner-wrap row-bg-layer\" ><div class=\"row-bg viewport-desktop\"  style=\"\"></div></div></div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12 col span_12 dark left\">\n\t<div style=\"\" class=\"vc_col-sm-6 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col padding-5-percent inherit_tablet inherit_phone \" data-using-bg=\"true\" data-bg-cover=\"true\" data-padding-pos=\"all\" data-has-bg-color=\"false\" data-bg-color=\"\" data-bg-opacity=\"1\" data-animation=\"\" data-delay=\"0\" >\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\" ><div class=\"column-image-bg-wrap column-bg-layer viewport-desktop\" data-bg-pos=\"center center\" data-bg-animation=\"zoom-out-reveal\" data-bg-overlay=\"false\"><div class=\"inner-wrap\"><div class=\"column-image-bg\" style=\" background-image: url('https://livingrhea.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/RHEA_10-scaled.jpg'); \"></div></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"divider-wrap\" data-alignment=\"default\"><div style=\"height: 100px;\" class=\"divider\"></div></div>\n\t\t\t</div> \n\t\t</div>\n\t</div> \n\n\t<div  class=\"vc_col-sm-6 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col padding-2-percent inherit_tablet inherit_phone \"  data-padding-pos=\"top-bottom\" data-has-bg-color=\"false\" data-bg-color=\"\" data-bg-opacity=\"1\" data-animation=\"\" data-delay=\"0\" >\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\" >\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"nectar-split-heading \" data-align=\"default\" data-m-align=\"inherit\" data-text-effect=\"default\" data-animation-type=\"line-reveal-by-space\" data-animation-delay=\"0\" data-animation-offset=\"\" data-m-rm-animation=\"\" data-stagger=\"\" data-custom-font-size=\"false\" ><h2 style=\"max-width: 450px;\">RHEA’S APPROACH</h2></div><div id=\"fws_6ae14cb64178d\" data-midnight=\"\" data-column-margin=\"default\" class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row inner_row\"  style=\"\"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\"> <div class=\"row-bg\" ></div> </div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12_inner col span_12  left\">\n\t<div  class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column has-animation no-extra-padding inherit_tablet inherit_phone \"   data-padding-pos=\"all\" data-has-bg-color=\"false\" data-bg-color=\"\" data-bg-opacity=\"1\" data-animation=\"fade-in-from-bottom\" data-delay=\"0\" >\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\" >\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \" style=\" max-width: 500px; display: inline-block;\">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t<p><strong>My approach blends evidence-based science with root-cause holistic healing to help you return to your most energized, empowered self.</strong></p>\n<p>As a <strong>holistic </strong><strong>health coach, toxicologist, and nutrition scientist</strong>, I guide you through a personalized journey of healing, rooted in deep listening, strategic insight, and sustainable transformation. Together, we’ll <strong>uncover the root causes of imbalance and co-create a plan that includes nutrition upgrades, healing rituals, and supportive habits</strong> tailored to your body’s needs.</p>\n<p>I’ll be your guide, educator, and accountability partner, helping you move <strong>from intention to integration</strong>, until your wellness practices become second nature. This work is more than optimization. It&#8217;s a return to your <strong>truest self</strong>, and a lifestyle that reflects your vitality, clarity, and power.</p>\n<p>When the moment calls for deeper integration, I draw on my training in <strong>Vedic (Indian) breathwork and kriya yoga</strong> to help you anchor into your body, regulate your nervous system, and reconnect with your inner knowing. <strong>Healing isn’t just physical &#8211; it’s emotional, spiritual, and deeply personal.</strong> These tools become part of the journey when you&#8217;re ready for them.</p>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"nectar-cta  alignment_tablet_default alignment_phone_default display_tablet_inherit display_phone_inherit \" data-color=\"default\" data-using-bg=\"false\" data-style=\"arrow-animation\" data-display=\"block\" data-alignment=\"left\" data-text-color=\"custom\" ><h4 style=\"color: #ff6716;\"><span class=\"link_wrap\" ><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"link_text\" role=\"button\" href=\"https://livingrhea.com/coaching/\"><span class=\"text\">BOOK A CONSULTATION</span><svg class=\"next-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20px\" height=\"25px\" viewBox=\"0 0 50 80\" xml:space=\"preserve\">\n  <polyline stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"9\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" points=\"0, 0 45, 40 0, 80\"/>\n  </svg>  <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line\"  style=\"background-color: #ff6716;\"></span> </a></span></h4></div>\n\t\t</div> \n\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div>\n\t\t\t</div> \n\t\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div>\n\t\t<div id=\"fws_6ae14cb642626\"  data-column-margin=\"default\" data-midnight=\"dark\"  class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row\"  style=\"padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; \"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\" data-bg-animation=\"none\" data-bg-animation-delay=\"\" data-bg-overlay=\"false\"><div class=\"inner-wrap row-bg-layer\" ><div class=\"row-bg viewport-desktop\"  style=\"\"></div></div></div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12 col span_12 dark left\">\n\t<div  class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col no-extra-padding inherit_tablet inherit_phone \"  data-padding-pos=\"all\" data-has-bg-color=\"false\" data-bg-color=\"\" data-bg-opacity=\"1\" data-animation=\"\" data-delay=\"0\" >\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\" >\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"testimonial_slider span_12 col disable-height-animation\" data-color=\"\" data-rating-color=\"accent-color\" data-controls=\"default\" data-add-border=\"\" data-autorotate=\"5000\" data-style=\"default\" ><div class=\"slides\"><blockquote> <div data-shadow=\"\" class=\"image-icon \" >&#8220;</div> <p>The biggest impact Rhea’s approach had on me was that she taught as much as she coached, and truly practiced what she shared. She guided me through a detox protocol, but also gave me skills and hacks for a lifetime of understanding how to navigate my health and well-being. I learned about practices, supplements, foods, treatments and practitioners that still serve me today—all because Rhea took the time to do the research and experimentation so others could benefit from her learnings. Rhea is not only a well-th of knowledge, but also an inspired soul who truly believes in the power of nutrition, knowledge and intention for all people to thrive and live well. <span role=\"none\" class=\"bottom-arrow\"></span></p><span class=\"testimonial-name\">Hima Batavia</span><span class=\"title\"></span></blockquote><blockquote> <div data-shadow=\"\" class=\"image-icon \" >&#8220;</div> <p>Rhea’s passion is infectious. Her intrepid pursuit of her passion has inspired me to follow mine; and I’ll always be grateful to her for her limitless generosity. <span role=\"none\" class=\"bottom-arrow\"></span></p><span class=\"testimonial-name\">Rahul Sarugaser</span><span class=\"title\"></span></blockquote><blockquote> <div data-shadow=\"\" class=\"image-icon \" >&#8220;</div> <p>Dr. Rhea is unbelievably informed and conveys her message with pure love. True love of people, love of food, love of radiant health and love of knowledge. She is a joyful leader and a true healer. <span role=\"none\" class=\"bottom-arrow\"></span></p><span class=\"testimonial-name\">Erin Diedling</span><span class=\"title\"></span></blockquote><blockquote> <div data-shadow=\"\" class=\"image-icon \" >&#8220;</div> <p>Rhea offers a graceful combination of practical day-to-day logistical advice mixed with big-picture visioning. Working with her has triggered deep personal growth for me in terms of my diet, stress reduction, and even how I approach the world and my relationships. She is a patient and conscious listener and fantastic at answering the hard questions while helping you incorporate practices into your everyday life to stay. It is clear to me that what I’m learning with Rhea’s help will become cemented as habits and “ways of being” that will making a lasting impact on my well being. I’m extremely thankful to have stumbled into the opportunity to work with Rhea. It’s pretty rare to get to work with someone who has such in depth medical and scientific training (both in Eastern and Western philosophies), who also has so much to offer in the realm of mindfulness, intention-setting, and overall living more joyfully! <span role=\"none\" class=\"bottom-arrow\"></span></p><span class=\"testimonial-name\">Jess R</span><span class=\"title\"></span></blockquote><blockquote> <div data-shadow=\"\" class=\"image-icon \" >&#8220;</div> <p>Working with Rhea was one of the first times that I learned what it truly meant to feel safe in my body. I was able to sleep soundly. Focus better. And most importantly, build a relationship with my body and heart where I felt capable and empowered. <span role=\"none\" class=\"bottom-arrow\"></span></p><span class=\"testimonial-name\">Priya Sankara</span><span class=\"title\"></span></blockquote></div></div>\n\t\t\t</div> \n\t\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div>\n\t\t<div id=\"freeGuide\"  data-column-margin=\"default\" data-midnight=\"light\" data-top-percent=\"10%\" data-bottom-percent=\"10%\"  class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row full-width-section parallax_section\"  style=\"padding-top: calc(100vw * 0.10); padding-bottom: calc(100vw * 0.10); \"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\" data-bg-animation=\"none\" data-bg-animation-delay=\"\" data-bg-overlay=\"true\"><div class=\"inner-wrap row-bg-layer using-image\" ><div class=\"row-bg viewport-desktop using-image\" data-parallax-speed=\"fast\" style=\"background-image: url(https://themenectar.com/img/demo-media/unsplash/webp/large-mountains-2.webp); background-position: left top; background-repeat: no-repeat; \"></div></div><div class=\"row-bg-overlay row-bg-layer\" style=\"background-color:rgba(10,10,10,0.67);  opacity: 0.5; \"></div></div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12 col span_12 light left\">\n\t<div  class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col no-extra-padding inherit_tablet inherit_phone \"  data-padding-pos=\"all\" data-has-bg-color=\"false\" data-bg-color=\"\" data-bg-opacity=\"1\" data-animation=\"\" data-delay=\"0\" >\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\" >\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<div id=\"fws_6ae14cb643888\" data-midnight=\"\" data-column-margin=\"default\" class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row inner_row vc_row-o-equal-height vc_row-flex vc_row-o-content-middle\"  style=\"\"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\"> <div class=\"row-bg\" ></div> </div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12_inner col span_12  left\">\n\t<div  class=\"vc_col-sm-6 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column no-extra-padding inherit_tablet inherit_phone \"   data-padding-pos=\"all\" data-has-bg-color=\"false\" data-bg-color=\"\" data-bg-opacity=\"1\" data-animation=\"\" data-delay=\"0\" >\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\" >\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"nectar_cascading_images\" data-border-radius=\"none\" data-parallax=\"\" data-parallax-intensity=\"subtle\" data-animation-timing=\"175\"><div class=\"cascading-image\" data-has-img=\"true\" style=\" padding:19%;\" data-max-width=\"100%\" data-max-width-mobile=\"100%\" da